data: {"id": "3d497b75512a4836-thinking-parallel_evidence-1116", "run_id": "3d497b75512a4836", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已基于工具结果完成了对 `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` 的调查。以下是事实汇总、因果分析与冲突/缺口说明。\n\n### 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` (UID: `bffd1771-cb0a-4bea-96ed-0a46e5b3a923`)\n- **控制器**: 归属于 `ReplicaSet/workload-dff5cbc6b`。\n- **节点**: 调度在 `node2` (10.2.0.50)，IP 为 `172.16.104.7`。\n- **当前状态**: Pod 处于 `Running` 阶段，但 `app` 容器处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，且 `Ready=False`。\n\n### 证据与因果分析\n\n**1. 异常现象（事实）**\n*   **K8s 事件**: 持续报错 `Back-off restarting failed container app`（累计 221 次），状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n*   **重启趋", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788794827454, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

